<title>USA: American United Q4 shr loss with charges.</title>
<headline>American United Q4 shr loss with charges.</headline>
<dateline>BELLEVUE, Wash. 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>July 31, 1996     Q4     July 31, 1995</p>
<p> Shr	  loss	  $2.10   profit	 $0.11</p>
